{"book":"Exodus","chapter":16,"entries":[{"id":1948,"title":"Exodus 16:1","segments":["¶And they took their journey from Elim, and all the congregation of the children of Israel came unto the wilderness of Sin, which [is] between Elim and Sinai, on the fifteenth day of the second month after their departing out of the land of Egypt."],"ref":"Exodus 16:1","verse":1,"words":[{"text":"¶And they took their journey","strong":"H5265"},{"text":" from Elim","strong":"H362"},{"text":", and all the congregation","strong":"H5712"},{"text":" of the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" came","strong":"H935"},{"text":" unto the wilderness","strong":"H4057"},{"text":" of Sin","strong":"H5512"},{"text":", which [is] between Elim","strong":"H362"},{"text":" and Sinai","strong":"H5514"},{"text":", on the fifteenth","strong":"H2568"},{"text":"","strong":"H6240"},{"text":" day","strong":"H3117"},{"text":" of the second","strong":"H8145"},{"text":" month","strong":"H2320"},{"text":" after their departing out","strong":"H3318"},{"text":" of the land","strong":"H776"},{"text":" of Egypt","strong":"H4714"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":1949,"title":"Exodus 16:2","segments":["And the whole congregation of the children of Israel murmured against Moses and Aaron in the wilderness:"],"ref":"Exodus 16:2","verse":2,"words":[{"text":"And the whole congregation","strong":"H5712"},{"text":" of the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" murmured","strong":"H3885"},{"text":" against Moses","strong":"H4872"},{"text":" and Aaron","strong":"H175"},{"text":" in the wilderness","strong":"H4057"},{"text":":"}]},{"id":1950,"title":"Exodus 16:3","segments":["And the children of Israel said unto them, Would to God we had died by the hand of the LORD in the land of Egypt, when we sat by the flesh pots, [and] when we did eat bread to the full; for ye have brought us forth into this wilderness, to kill this whole assembly with hunger."],"ref":"