,{"text":"."}]},{"id":1960,"title":"Exodus 16:13","segments":["¶And it came to pass, that at even the quails came up, and covered the camp: and in the morning the dew lay round about the host."],"ref":"Exodus 16:13","verse":13,"words":[{"text":"¶And it came to pass, that at even","strong":"H6153"},{"text":" the quails","strong":"H7958"},{"text":" came up","strong":"H5927"},{"text":", and covered","strong":"H3680"},{"text":" the camp","strong":"H4264"},{"text":": and in the morning","strong":"H1242"},{"text":" the dew","strong":"H2919"},{"text":" lay","strong":"H7902"},{"text":" round about","strong":"H5439"},{"text":" the host","strong":"H4264"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":1961,"title":"Exodus 16:14","segments":["And when the dew that lay was gone up, behold, upon the face of the wilderness [there lay] a small round thing, [as] small as the hoar frost on the ground."],"ref":"Exodus 16:14","verse":14,"words":[{"text":"And when the dew","strong":"H2919"},{"text":" that lay","strong":"H7902"},{"text":" was gone up","strong":"H5927"},{"text":", behold, upon the face","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" of the wilderness","strong":"H4057"},{"text":" [there lay] a small","strong":"H1851"},{"text":" round thing","strong":"H2636"},{"text":", [as] small","strong":"H1851"},{"text":" as the hoar frost","strong":"H3713"},{"text":" on the ground","strong":"H776"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":1962,"title":"Exodus 16:15","segments":["And when the children of Israel saw [it], they said one to another, It [is] manna: for they wist not what it [was]. And Moses said unto them, This [is] the bread which the LORD hath given you to eat. {It is...: or, What is this? or, It is a portion}"],"ref":"Exodus 16:15","verse":15,"words":[{"text":"And when the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" saw","strong":"H7200"},{"text":" [it], they said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" one","strong":"H376"},{"text":" to another","strong":"H251"},{"text":", It [is] manna","strong":"H4478"},{"text